  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The incident occurred during morning prayers at the Darul Ma'arif mosque located in the Pondok Kelapa area of East Jakarta. Local authorities and national institutions, including the Ministry of Religious Affairs, have responded to the violence, urging a thorough investigation into the matter. Following the attack, police secured evidence from the scene, including a hatchet and gasoline. Law enforcement officials have also initiated psychiatric evaluations to determine the mental state of the suspect currently in custody. While the investigation remains ongoing, the Governor of Jakarta, Pramono Anung, has issued a public statement condemning the act and insisting that the legal process be handled with the utmost rigor to ensure public safety and accountability. Other government bodies, including the People's Consultative Assembly, have previously echoed calls for a comprehensive resolution to the case.",
